{"id":"634823","name":"荞麦面窝窝头","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/634823/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荞麦面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"200克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青红辣椒","amount":"各适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好荞麦面粉。","img":"images/634823/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取300克。","img":"images/634823/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加200克开水烫面。","img":"images/634823/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"稍搅拌会，加入两个鸡蛋。","img":"images/634823/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌成大面絮，晾至温热后，加入酵母。","img":"images/634823/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用手揉成光滑的面团，放至温暖处发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/634823/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"发酵好的面团。","img":"images/634823/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"发酵好的面团。","img":"images/634823/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再次揉光滑，排气。","img":"images/634823/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"分成50克一个的小剂子。","img":"images/634823/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"团圆。","img":"images/634823/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"底部用手指按个洞洞。","img":"images/634823/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入蒸锅中，再次醒发20分钟。","img":"images/634823/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"趁着窝窝头醒发的时候，我们来做夹心，鸡胸肉、洋葱、大蒜头、青红辣椒、豆腐都切成末。","img":"images/634823/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"鸡胸肉加入盐、胡椒粉、鸡精、蚝油、生抽、老抽抓匀，腌一会儿。","img":"images/634823/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"起锅烧热，加油(做的减脂餐，油只用了5克)，下入鸡胸肉翻炒变色。","img":"images/634823/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"下入豆腐翻炒断生。","img":"images/634823/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"加入洋葱，翻炒断生。","img":"images/634823/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"加入青红辣椒和大蒜头，翻炒断生。","img":"images/634823/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"翻炒均匀后，加盐、蚝油、生抽、老抽。","img":"images/634823/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/634823/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"加入鸡精，翻炒均匀盛出待用。","img":"images/634823/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"窝窝头凉水上锅，出气后，蒸15分钟后关火，再虚蒸3分钟。","img":"images/634823/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/634823/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/634823/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/634823/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/634823/step_27.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}